\title{tenniscareer: Retrieve and Plot Tennis Career Matches from Tennis Abstract}
\description{
Downloads a professional tennis player's career match file from Tennis Abstract \url{https://www.tennisabstract.com/}, parses the JavaScript match array, and returns a clean data frame with the player's age, the opponent's age, the age difference, and the outcome of every played match. Handles both the women's format (opponent date of birth) and the men's format (opponent age). A companion function draws a scatter plot of age difference against the player's age, coloured by wins and losses.
